Subject: [PATCH 190/252] feat(tools): add C7 decode-gap diagnostic scripts (no
 implementation change)

- analyze_decode_gap.py: lock-free reuse of Q3 raw dumps; per-row decode
  cosine/max_abs curves, triangle relations, cosine-gate-implied L2 budget,
  reference-self distributions.
- state_trajectory_ours.py: ours-only state invariants (KV prefix, conv
  sliding window, finiteness) and step-to-step state change.
- dump_gold_states.py: dump official HF w8a8 conv/GDR/KV states on the
  same inference path (fallback-safe, bitwise validation vs existing gold).
- compare_states.py: ours-vs-gold state comparison per layer/step.
- state_swap_experiment.py: oracle state-swap attribution (state reflow vs
  per-step compute) + per-layer ablation, run on the HF gold model.
- render_tables.py / summarize_swap.py / make_evidence_manifest.py and the
  heavy-lock wrappers (run_c7_heavy.sh etc).

Diagnostic only: does not modify implementation, judge, band or comparison
objects.
